# Keep Foundry agent instruction artifacts checked out with LF line endings so
# they stay byte-for-byte identical to the inline `definition.instructions`
# value in each foundry-agent.json manifest. The foundry-agent-manifests test
# compares the two exactly, which would otherwise fail on Windows runners where
# core.autocrlf converts the artifacts to CRLF on checkout.
packages/agents/*/prompts/instructions.md text eol=lf
